    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# OZ Avala LinkedIn Mega Workflow\n\n## Phase 1: Job Discovery (Top)\n1. Form Trigger → Enter search criteria\n2. Scrape LinkedIn Jobs via Apify\n3. Save to Google Sheets (Jobs Database)\n\n## Phase 2: Decision Maker Research (Middle)\n1. Get new jobs from sheet\n2. Loop over each job\n3. Find company in Apollo\n4. Search for HR/recruiting contacts\n5. Score and filter top 5 decision makers\n6. Save leads to sheet\n\n## Phase 3: Lead Enrichment & Outreach (Bottom)\n1. Get new leads from sheet\n2. Loop over each lead\n3. Enrich profile via LinkFinder AI\n4. Generate personalized message in Serbian (Claude)\n5. Save enriched data + message to sheet\n6. Status: ready_to_send\n\n## Manual Step\nReview messages in Google Sheets.\nChange status from 'ready_to_send' to 'approved'.\nThen use ConnectSafely or manual sending.",
        "height": 720,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
